    <string name="wear_empty_description">Records begin when LibrePods detects either AirPod in your ear. Keep its background service running; music does not need to be playing. Earlier history cannot be recovered.</string>
    <string name="wear_recording_note">Stored only on this phone. Either bud in ear starts a session; both out or a lost connection ends it. In BLE-only mode, verified nearby signals are used until they expire. Time is split at local midnight. Each period counts every overlapping session once; average and longest use only the portion within that period. Weeks start on Monday. Interrupted tracking ends at the last checkpoint.</string>
